  "category": "Dry",
  "description": "Our Rice-A-Roni Spanish Rice blends tender rice and vermicelli with Spanish seasonings to create a zesty taste that the whole family will enjoy. This flavorful dish is a great complement to your favorite Spanish-inspired chicken, pork or beef recipes. Rice-A-Roni Spanish Rice is a flavorful and convenient side dish that brings a taste of the Southwest to your table. This 6.8 oz box combines rice and vermicelli pasta with a zesty blend of spices, including tomatoes, onions, and bell peppers. Easy to prepare, it cooks in just 20 minutes, making it perfect for busy weeknights or as a complement to your favorite Mexican or grilled dishes. Enjoy the delicious, savory flavors that make every meal a celebration!",
